            "goal_contract_version": 1,
            "hypothesis": "The locally selected q=1 Block Krylov endpoint can preserve the frozen eta=.1 Landmark trajectory quality while reducing refresh cost.",
            "idea": "lra-block-krylov-baseline-v1",
            "interpretation": "Block Krylov's apparent dense-SVD advantage is removed by the strong simple sparse-support baseline. Quality comes from52-65 active columns and rank saturation, not scalable convergence. The classical endpoint is valid but practically dominated on this native trajectory.",
