            "next_action": "Retire the Block Krylov endpoint direction without native5000 expansion. Scope one downstream model application under CPU/8GB, beginning with a reproducible labeled discriminative benchmark and explicit full-data, uniform/reservoir, sparse-exact, and standard dimensionality-reduction baselines before any training.",
